{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"46intro000000001","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":6500,"height":270,"text":"# 财务报表、财务比率与财务预测\n\n从完整课程连续阅读，再回到这里定位关系。\n\n**财务管理：**[[02_Economy/05_财务管理/02_财务分析与融资预测|报表 → 经营与融资 → 增长所需资金]]\n\n**证券投资学：**[[02_Economy/06_证券投资学/06_财务报表与公司诊断|报表 → 比率与质量 → BW / 格力完整案例]]\n\n分区颜色用于导航，不代表掌握程度。概念链接打开定义；独立边界另有节点。"},
		{"id":"46group000000001","type":"group","x":0,"y":430,"width":1940,"height":990,"label":"报表与勾稽","color":"4"},
		{"id":"46bridge00000001","type":"text","x":30,"y":460,"width":1880,"height":90,"text":"时点余额与期间流量通过利润、权益和现金相接。"},
		{"id":"46card0000000001","type":"text","x":40,"y":590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[财务报表]]\n\n先识别完整报表集合"},
		{"id":"46card0000000002","type":"text","x":760,"y":590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[资产负债表]]\n\n某日资源及其融资来源"},
		{"id":"46card0000000007","type":"text","x":1480,"y":590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[会计恒等式]]\n\n同一时点 A = L + E"},
		{"id":"46card0000000003","type":"text","x":40,"y":850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[利润表]]\n\n期间收入、费用与损益"},
		{"id":"46card0000000005","type":"text","x":760,"y":850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[所有者权益变动表]]\n\n利润之外还有投入、分配与OCI"},
		{"id":"46card0000000008","type":"text","x":1480,"y":850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[财务报表勾稽]]\n\n逐项解释余额为何变化"},
		{"id":"46card0000000004","type":"text","x":40,"y":1110,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[现金流量表]]\n\n经营、投资、筹资与调节项"},
		{"id":"46card0000000006","type":"text","x":760,"y":1110,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[财务报表附注]]\n\n确认、估计和明细的证据"},
		{"id":"46group000000002","type":"group","x":2280,"y":430,"width":1940,"height":990,"label":"分析问题与信息质量","color":"2"},
		{"id":"46bridge00000002","type":"text","x":2310,"y":460,"width":1880,"height":90,"text":"先问要做什么决策，再核对报表是否支持这个判断。"},
		{"id":"46card0000000021","type":"text","x":2320,"y":590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"2","text":"### [[财务报表分析]]\n\n围绕决策解释财务数字"},
		{"id":"46card0000000101","type":"text","x":3040,"y":590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"2","text":"### [[财务报表局限]]\n\n会计数字不等于经济价值"},
		{"id":"46card0000000102","type":"text","x":3760,"y":590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"2","text":"### [[盈利质量]]\n\n利润的真实表现与持续性"},
		{"id":"46card0000000103","type":"text","x":2320,"y":850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"2","text":"### [[盈利质量核查]]\n\n从异常追到可验证证据"},
		{"id":"46card0000000104","type":"text","x":3040,"y":850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"2","text":"### [[关联方交易]]\n\n关联方间资源、服务或义务转移"},
		{"id":"46card0000000105","type":"text","x":3760,"y":850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"2","text":"### [[关联交易不等于利润操纵]]\n\n关联关系不是违规的充分证据"},
		{"id":"46card0000000106","type":"text","x":2320,"y":1110,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"2","text":"### [[现金营运指数]]\n\nCFO 对照调整后经营所得现金"},
		{"id":"46group000000003","type":"group","x":4560,"y":430,"width":1940,"height":990,"label":"比较与分解方法","color":"3"},
		{"id":"46bridge00000003","type":"text","x":4590,"y":460,"width":1880,"height":90,"text":"比较先统一口径，分解再交代函数与替代顺序。"},
		{"id":"46card0000000022","type":"text","x":4600,"y":590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[财务报表比较分析]]\n\n同业、历史与预算三类基准"},
		{"id":"46card0000000023","type":"text","x":5320,"y":590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[结构百分比报表]]\n\n同一基数消除绝对规模差异"},
		{"id":"46card0000000026","type":"text","x":6040,"y":590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[财务比率]]\n\n两个财务量构成明确比值"},
		{"id":"46card0000000024","type":"text","x":4600,"y":850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[连环替代法]]\n\n沿选定路径分摊结果差额"},
		{"id":"46card0000000025","type":"text","x":5320,"y":850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[连环替代顺序边界]]\n\n单项贡献依赖替代顺序"},
		{"id":"46card0000000027","type":"text","x":6040,"y":850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[财务比率口径匹配]]\n\n主体、期间、存量和权利范围"},
		{"id":"46group000000004","type":"group","x":0,"y":1560,"width":1940,"height":1410,"label":"偿债与融资结构","color":"1"},
		{"id":"46bridge00000004","type":"text","x":30,"y":1590,"width":1880,"height":90,"text":"金额缓冲、账面比例和到期付款能力分别检查。"},
		{"id":"46card0000000028","type":"text","x":40,"y":1720,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[营运资本]]\n\n全部流动资产减流动负债"},
		{"id":"46card0000000030","type":"text","x":760,"y":1720,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[流动比率]]\n\n流动资产 / 流动负债"},
		{"id":"46card0000000034","type":"text","x":1480,"y":1720,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[资产负债率]]\n\n全部负债 / 全部资产"},
		{"id":"46card0000000029","type":"text","x":40,"y":1980,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[营运资本融资恒等式]]\n\n长期资本减非流动资产"},
		{"id":"46card0000000031","type":"text","x":760,"y":1980,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[速动比率]]\n\n明确速动资产范围"},
		{"id":"46card0000000035","type":"text","x":1480,"y":1980,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[产权比率]]\n\n全部负债 / 股东权益"},
		{"id":"46card0000000033","type":"text","x":40,"y":2240,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[现金流量比率]]\n\n期间 CFO / 指定流动负债"},
		{"id":"46card0000000032","type":"text","x":760,"y":2240,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[现金比率]]\n\n货币资金口径，另查可用性"},
		{"id":"46card0000000036","type":"text","x":1480,"y":2240,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[权益乘数]]\n\n资产 / 权益 = 1 + 负债/权益"},
		{"id":"46card0000000039","type":"text","x":40,"y":2500,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[现金流量利息保障倍数]]\n\nCFO 与同口径利息支出"},
		{"id":"46card0000000038","type":"text","x":760,"y":2500,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[利息保障倍数]]\n\nEBIT 对利息的利润覆盖"},
		{"id":"46card0000000037","type":"text","x":1480,"y":2500,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[长期资本负债率]]\n\n非流动负债 / 长期资本"},
		{"id":"46card0000000040","type":"text","x":40,"y":2760,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[现金流量与负债比率]]\n\nCFO 相对全部负债"},
		{"id":"46card0000000041","type":"text","x":760,"y":2760,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### [[偿债能力的报表外核查]]\n\n期限、限制、授信与或有义务"},
		{"id":"46group000000005","type":"group","x":2280,"y":1560,"width":1940,"height":1410,"label":"周转与资金占用","color":"5"},
		{"id":"46bridge00000005","type":"text","x":2310,"y":1590,"width":1880,"height":90,"text":"先匹配收入或成本流量，再定位是哪类资产占用。"},
		{"id":"46card0000000042","type":"text","x":2320,"y":1720,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[应收账款周转率]]\n\n赊销与应收范围必须匹配"},
		{"id":"46card0000000043","type":"text","x":3040,"y":1720,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[存货周转率]]\n\n成本流量对应存货存量"},
		{"id":"46card0000000044","type":"text","x":3760,"y":1720,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[存货周转的收入与成本口径]]\n\n毛利差异改变次数与天数"},
		{"id":"46card0000000045","type":"text","x":2320,"y":1980,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[流动资产周转率]]\n\n销售 / 流动资产"},
		{"id":"46card0000000046","type":"text","x":3040,"y":1980,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[营运资本周转率]]\n\n先说明哪一种营运资本"},
		{"id":"46card0000000047","type":"text","x":3760,"y":1980,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[非流动资产周转率]]\n\n销售 / 非流动资产"},
		{"id":"46card0000000048","type":"text","x":2320,"y":2240,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[总资产周转率]]\n\n每元资产支持多少销售"},
		{"id":"46card0000000049","type":"text","x":3040,"y":2240,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[资产周转分解]]\n\n同收入分母可加，次数不可加"},
		{"id":"46group000000006","type":"group","x":4560,"y":1560,"width":1940,"height":1410,"label":"利润率、资产回报与ROE","color":"6"},
		{"id":"46bridge00000006","type":"text","x":4590,"y":1590,"width":1880,"height":90,"text":"杜邦要求同一净利润与同一存量口径，EBIT版另读。"},
		{"id":"46card0000000077","type":"text","x":4600,"y":1720,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### [[毛利率]]\n\n收入减对应成本后的比例"},
		{"id":"46card0000000078","type":"text","x":5320,"y":1720,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### [[营业利润率]]\n\n按明确报表的营业利润口径"},
		{"id":"46card0000000050","type":"text","x":6040,"y":1720,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### [[营业净利率]]\n\n净利润 / 营业收入"},
		{"id":"46card0000000079","type":"text","x":4600,"y":1980,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### [[EBIT资产盈利率]]\n\n融资税前利润 / 匹配总资产"},
		{"id":"46card0000000051","type":"text","x":5320,"y":1980,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### [[总资产净利率]]\n\n净利润 / 匹配总资产"},
		{"id":"46card0000000052","type":"text","x":6040,"y":1980,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### [[权益净利率]]\n\n对应股东利润 / 对应账面权益"},
		{"id":"46card0000000053","type":"text","x":4600,"y":2240,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### [[杜邦分解]]\n\n净利率 × 周转率 × 权益乘数"},
		{"id":"46card0000000054","type":"text","x":5320,"y":2240,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### [[ROE与杠杆的解释边界]]\n\n高ROE不单独证明经营更好"},
		{"id":"46group000000007","type":"group","x":0,"y":3170,"width":1940,"height":1720,"label":"经营与融资分开读","color":"5"},
		{"id":"46bridge00000007","type":"text","x":30,"y":3200,"width":1880,"height":90,"text":"完整重分类后，同时核对资本、损益和现金的勾稽。"},
		{"id":"46card0000000055","type":"text","x":40,"y":3330,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[管理用报表分类]]\n\n按实际业务功能分类"},
		{"id":"46card0000000056","type":"text","x":760,"y":3330,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[净经营资产]]\n\n经营资产减经营负债"},
		{"id":"46card0000000058","type":"text","x":1480,"y":3330,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[净金融负债]]\n\n金融负债减金融资产"},
		{"id":"46card0000000057","type":"text","x":40,"y":3590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[经营营运资本]]\n\n经营流动资产减经营流动负债"},
		{"id":"46card0000000059","type":"text","x":760,"y":3590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[管理用资产负债表恒等式]]\n\nNOA = NFD + E"},
		{"id":"46card0000000067","type":"text","x":1480,"y":3590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[净财务杠杆]]\n\nNFD / E，不是经营杠杆"},
		{"id":"46card0000000060","type":"text","x":40,"y":3850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[税后经营净利润]]\n\n经营利润减经营税额"},
		{"id":"46card0000000061","type":"text","x":760,"y":3850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[净融资费用]]\n\n金融费用与金融收益净额"},
		{"id":"46card0000000062","type":"text","x":1480,"y":3850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[管理用利润表拆分]]\n\nNI = NOPAT − 税后净融资费"},
		{"id":"46card0000000063","type":"text","x":40,"y":4110,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[管理用现金流量]]\n\n生产性投资归经营侧"},
		{"id":"46card0000000064","type":"text","x":760,"y":4110,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[自由现金流的净经营资产表示]]\n\n现金再投资匹配后才扣 ΔNOA"},
		{"id":"46card0000000065","type":"text","x":1480,"y":4110,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[净经营资产净利率]]\n\nNOPAT / 匹配NOA"},
		{"id":"46card0000000s83","type":"text","x":40,"y":4370,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[企业自由现金流]]\n\n复用：经营税后、再投资后"},
		{"id":"46card0000000s84","type":"text","x":760,"y":4370,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[投入资本回报率]]\n\n复用：先对齐资本与日期"},
		{"id":"46card0000000066","type":"text","x":1480,"y":4370,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### [[管理用ROE分解]]\n\nRNOA + 经营融资利差 × NFL"},
		{"id":"46group000000008","type":"group","x":2280,"y":3170,"width":1940,"height":1720,"label":"每股金额与市场倍数","color":"4"},
		{"id":"46bridge00000008","type":"text","x":2310,"y":3200,"width":1880,"height":90,"text":"普通股的权利范围、股数日期和盈利期间分别固定。"},
		{"id":"46card0000000071","type":"text","x":2320,"y":3330,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[基本每股收益]]\n\n普通股利润 / 加权平均股数"},
		{"id":"46card0000000072","type":"text","x":3040,"y":3330,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[稀释每股收益]]\n\n分子分母同步计入稀释影响"},
		{"id":"46card0000000109","type":"text","x":3760,"y":3330,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[市盈率]]\n\n价格 / 指定EPS"},
		{"id":"46card0000000073","type":"text","x":2320,"y":3590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[每股净资产]]\n\n普通股账面权益 / 同时点股数"},
		{"id":"46card0000000074","type":"text","x":3040,"y":3590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[账面净资产不是股价下限]]\n\n账面计量不是保证兑付"},
		{"id":"46card0000000110","type":"text","x":3760,"y":3590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[市净率]]\n\n价格 / 同口径BVPS"},
		{"id":"46card0000000075","type":"text","x":2320,"y":3850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[每股经营现金流]]\n\n先明确CFO与股数口径"},
		{"id":"46card0000000076","type":"text","x":3040,"y":3850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[每股经营现金流不限定股利]]\n\n现金生成不等于可分配利润"},
		{"id":"46card0000000111","type":"text","x":3760,"y":3850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[市销率]]\n\n股权市值 / 收入，注意债务"},
		{"id":"46card0000000107","type":"text","x":2320,"y":4110,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[股利支付率]]\n\n股利 / 对应净利润"},
		{"id":"46card0000000108","type":"text","x":3040,"y":4110,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"### [[股利收益率]]\n\n期间每股现金股利 / 股价"},
		{"id":"46group000000009","type":"group","x":4560,"y":3170,"width":1940,"height":1720,"label":"增长、资金缺口与现金时点","color":"3"},
		{"id":"46bridge00000009","type":"text","x":4590,"y":3200,"width":1880,"height":90,"text":"收入假设带动经营占用；留存和融资补缺，再按月核现金。"},
		{"id":"46card0000000081","type":"text","x":4600,"y":3330,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[财务预测]]\n\n让未来报表与融资共同成立"},
		{"id":"46card0000000s81","type":"text","x":5320,"y":3330,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[收入驱动预测]]\n\n复用：量、价、组合与客户"},
		{"id":"46card0000000082","type":"text","x":6040,"y":3330,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[销售百分比法]]\n\n稳定比例假设下推经营占用"},
		{"id":"46card0000000083","type":"text","x":4600,"y":3590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[外部融资需求]]\n\n新增净经营资产减内部来源"},
		{"id":"46card0000000084","type":"text","x":5320,"y":3590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[利润留存率]]\n\n净利润中未分配的比例"},
		{"id":"46card0000000096","type":"text","x":6040,"y":3590,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[留存收益不是现金]]\n\n权益积累并非现金储备"},
		{"id":"46card0000000085","type":"text","x":4600,"y":3850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[融资利息循环]]\n\n借款改变利息，利息再改缺口"},
		{"id":"46card0000000086","type":"text","x":5320,"y":3850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[回归财务预测]]\n\n从经营驱动预测资产或费用"},
		{"id":"46card0000000091","type":"text","x":6040,"y":3850,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[外部融资销售增长比]]\n\n外部融资额 / 销售增量"},
		{"id":"46card0000000087","type":"text","x":4600,"y":4110,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[内含增长率]]\n\n不新增外部金融融资的条件解"},
		{"id":"46card0000000088","type":"text","x":5320,"y":4110,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[可持续增长率]]\n\n稳定政策下的增长支持边界"},
		{"id":"46card0000000089","type":"text","x":6040,"y":4110,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[增长率与权益时点]]\n\n期初与期末ROE对应不同公式"},
		{"id":"46card0000000090","type":"text","x":4600,"y":4370,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[实际增长与可持续增长]]\n\n政策变化产生过渡增长"},
		{"id":"46card0000000092","type":"text","x":5320,"y":4370,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[名义销售增长与融资]]\n\n数量与价格增长先合并口径"},
		{"id":"46card0000000093","type":"text","x":6040,"y":4370,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"### [[融资需求敏感性]]\n\n在给定假设下比较资金影响"},
